 "notes": "Venn's camp: an upside-down, fabric-covered radial-engine monoplane (wheels in the air, -x wingtip crumpled), about 9.3 m span by 6.9 m long at the scale bar's ~64 px/m. Next to it are an A-frame tent (~1.7 m wide, 1.75 m high), a camp table, a crate, three jerry cans and a stone fire ring. The plane's top view is shorter in span relative to its length than the front and side views, so a compromise was used (span:length ~1.35). The crate can't be picked out in the front or back views, so only its top view is listed. None of the camp items has a side view."}
